    "name": "Does a Dining Room Remodel Require a Permit in San Diego or Chula Vista?",
    "text": "Does a Dining Room Remodel Require a Permit in San Diego or Chula Vista?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "Whether a dining room remodel needs a permit depends on the work involved and the jurisdiction. Cosmetic updates such as painting, flooring, or cabinets may be exempt in some City of San Diego situations, while electrical, plumbing, mechanical, structural, expansion, or use changes generally require review; confirm the project scope with the applicable building department before work begins.",
